  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "We apply the options to the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven equation: 248 ÷ 4 + 184 ÷ ( 4 × 6 – 2 × 8) = 77\n\nOption 1) 8 and 4\n\nAfter Interchanging:\n\n⇒ 248 ÷ 8 + 184 ÷ __**( 4 × 6**__ – __**2 × 4)**__ = 77\n\n⇒ 248 ÷ 8 + 184 ÷ __(24____** – 8**____)__ = 77\n\n⇒ __**248 ÷ 8**__ + __**184 ÷ **____16__** = 77\n\n⇒ __**31 + 11.5**__ = 77\n\n⇒ 42.5 ≠ 77.\n\nGiven equation: 248 ÷ 4 + 184 ÷ ( 4 × 6 – 2 × 8) = 77\n\nOption 2) 184 and 77\n\nAfter interchanging:\n\n⇒ 248 ÷ 4 + 77 ÷ __**( 4 × 6**__ – __**2 × 8)**__ = 184\n\n⇒ 248 ÷ 4 + 77 ÷ __(24** – 16**)__ = 184\n\n⇒ __**248 ÷ 4**__ + __**77 ÷ **__**__8__** = 184\n\n⇒ __**62 + 9.6**__ = 184\n\n⇒ 71.6 ≠ 184.\n\nGiven equation: 248 ÷ 4 + 184 ÷ ( 4 × 6 – 2 × 8) = 77\n\nOption 3) 184 and 248\n\nAfter Interchanging:\n\n⇒ 184 ÷ 4 + 248 ÷ __**( 4 × 6 – 2 × 8)**__ = 77\n\n⇒ 184 ÷ 4 + 248 ÷ __(24 – 16)__ = 77\n\n⇒ __**184 ÷ 4**__ + __**248 ÷ **__**__8__** = 77\n\n⇒ __**46 + 31**__ = 77\n\n⇒ **77 = 77.**\n\nGiven equation: 248 ÷ 4 + 184 ÷ ( 4 × 6 – 2 × 8) = 77\n\nOption 4) 4 and 6\n\nAfter Interchanging:\n\n⇒ 248 ÷ 6 + 184 ÷ __**( 4 × 4 – 2 × 8)**__ = 77\n\n⇒ 248 ÷ 6 + 184 ÷ __(16 – 16)__ = 77\n\n⇒ __**248 ÷ 6**__ + __**184 ÷ **____0__ = 77\n\n⇒ __**41.3 + 0**__ = 77 \n\n⇒ 41.3 ≠ 77\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\".**",
